(5250388, 763771, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Beautiful eyes.  Some fur highlights may have lost some detail, but not too bad.  Blacked out bg is effective.  8</td>', 'Good composition.  Beautiful eyes.  Some fur highlights may have lost some detail, but not too bad.  Blacked out bg is effective.  8', '2009-02-11 10:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
