(5250395, 763836, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great focus and detail on the face and whiskers.  Beautiful eyes.  The bg rhymes with the eye color.  Very effective asymmetrical composition.  8</td>', 'Great focus and detail on the face and whiskers.  Beautiful eyes.  The bg rhymes with the eye color.  Very effective asymmetrical composition.  8', '2009-02-11 10:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
