(5250402, 764335, 54446, '<td valign="top">This one made me smile.... with amazement.  Nice surf action shot.  Bumping this up on review, after a second look.  This is the most unique image in this challenge.  9</td>', 'This one made me smile.... with amazement.  Nice surf action shot.  Bumping this up on review, after a second look.  This is the most unique image in this challenge.  9', '2009-02-11 10:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
