(5250410, 763118, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and wonderful soft light and expression.  I might crop tighter on the right to eliminate the other couch arm.  Not a biggie, though.</td>', 'Beautiful tones and wonderful soft light and expression.  I might crop tighter on the right to eliminate the other couch arm.  Not a biggie, though.', '2009-02-11 10:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250411, 763663, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very cute bunnies.  They look a bit terrified, but good exposure and effective non-distracting bg.  8</td>', 'Very cute bunnies.  They look a bit terrified, but good exposure and effective non-distracting bg.  8', '2009-02-11 10:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250413, 763123, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and detail.</td>', 'Beautiful light and detail.', '2009-02-11 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250415, 764289, 54446, '<td valign="top">My dog would never have tolerated being placed in a garbage can, but it is to your credit to get the dog to pose in this humiliating situation.  Good job on the whited out bg.  8</td>', 'My dog would never have tolerated being placed in a garbage can, but it is to your credit to get the dog to pose in this humiliating situation.  Good job on the whited out bg.  8', '2009-02-11 10:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250423, 763844, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  The eye color may be overdone by a notch, but it works for me.  8</td>', 'I like this very much.  The eye color may be overdone by a notch, but it works for me.  8', '2009-02-11 10:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250426, 764592, 54446, '<td valign="top">Extra points for the pose and expression.  8</td>', 'Extra points for the pose and expression.  8', '2009-02-11 10:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250427, 763790, 65234, '<td valign="top">That pose is great and the expression makes me smile :-)  I''m not a fan of the color of whatever s/he''s sitting on with the rest of the colors in the shot; since this is Basic I''d try a hue shift and desaturate some to more closely match the wall.</td>', 'That pose is great and the expression makes me smile :-)  I''m not a fan of the color of whatever s/he''s sitting on with the rest of the colors in the shot; since this is Basic I''d try a hue shift and desaturate some to more closely match the wall.', '2009-02-11 10:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250429, 764581, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good composition, fur texture and exposure.  Well done!  8</td>', 'Good composition, fur texture and exposure.  Well done!  8', '2009-02-11 10:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250431, 762922, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea and nice execution.  You must have an extremely tolerant cat!</td>', 'Very cute idea and nice execution.  You must have an extremely tolerant cat!', '2009-02-11 10:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250434, 764457, 65234, '<td valign="top">Completely adorable pose and expression.  Looks like a Ragdoll; they''re great cats.  Nicely lit, too.</td>', 'Completely adorable pose and expression.  Looks like a Ragdoll; they''re great cats.  Nicely lit, too.', '2009-02-11 10:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250436, 763486, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good pose, well captured.  Looks more like a boxer to me, but I like the title and the concept.  Good blurred bg.  8</td>', 'Good pose, well captured.  Looks more like a boxer to me, but I like the title and the concept.  Good blurred bg.  8', '2009-02-11 10:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250440, 763663, 65234, '<td valign="top">Too cute for words!  Great pose, just as sweet as anything could be.  And major bonus point from me for using bunnies :-)  Lighting is nice and background doesn''t draw attention.  Their little feet look yellowish which makes me think of urine stains; I''d either desaturate the yellow range or do this in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Too cute for words!  Great pose, just as sweet as anything could be.  And major bonus point from me for using bunnies :-)  Lighting is nice and background doesn''t draw attention.  Their little feet look yellowish which makes me think of urine stains; I''d either desaturate the yellow range or do this in B&W.', '2009-02-11 10:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250442, 764525, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and great profile portrait.  Maybe could use a little more DOF to get the nose in focus, too, but it''s not bad this way.  The eye is beautifully sharp and clearly conveys a devoted expression to me.  Looks like a little drop of eye goop, though; I try to check for those right before shooting and clean them off.  Personal pet peeve ;-)</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and great profile portrait.  Maybe could use a little more DOF to get the nose in focus, too, but it''s not bad this way.  The eye is beautifully sharp and clearly conveys a devoted expression to me.  Looks like a little drop of eye goop, though; I try to check for those right before shooting and clean them off.  Personal pet peeve ;-)', '2009-02-11 10:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250448, 763628, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely, classic portrait.  Nice detaail and tones and the sheen on the fur accentuates an athletic-looking body.</td>', 'Lovely, classic portrait.  Nice detaail and tones and the sheen on the fur accentuates an athletic-looking body.', '2009-02-11 10:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250449, 763844, 52500, '<td valign="top">That is a fantastic name.  We have a cat named Kitty, but Mr. Kitty Kitty takes the cake.  Great shot, too.</td>', 'That is a fantastic name.  We have a cat named Kitty, but Mr. Kitty Kitty takes the cake.  Great shot, too.', '2009-02-11 10:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250451, 764422, 9602, '<td valign="top">The sky is over-exposed.</td>', 'The sky is over-exposed.', '2009-02-11 10:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250454, 763113, 9602, '<td valign="top">Detail is lost on his face.</td>', 'Detail is lost on his face.', '2009-02-11 10:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250455, 764366, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous face :-)  Totally contradicts the spiky collar, especially with the ears tucked back submimssively.  Only suggestion I''d make it to take the shot from a little higher or lower so there wasn''t a drastic change in the background going through the top of his head.  Really well-captured expression, though, and that''s key.</td>', 'What a gorgeous face :-)  Totally contradicts the spiky collar, especially with the ears tucked back submimssively.  Only suggestion I''d make it to take the shot from a little higher or lower so there wasn''t a drastic change in the background going through the top of his head.  Really well-captured expression, though, and that''s key.', '2009-02-11 10:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250456, 764528, 9602, '<td valign="top">I would not have cropped his ear out like that.</td>', 'I would not have cropped his ear out like that.', '2009-02-11 10:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250458, 762844, 9602, '<td valign="top">The shadows are too harsh.</td>', 'The shadows are too harsh.', '2009-02-11 10:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250459, 763634, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and DOF is perfect.  Might like a slightly different angle so he didn''t look hunchbacked so much, and I''d clean off the little eye goobers.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and DOF is perfect.  Might like a slightly different angle so he didn''t look hunchbacked so much, and I''d clean off the little eye goobers.', '2009-02-11 10:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250461, 764181, 9602, '<td valign="top">The background here is too busy.</td>', 'The background here is too busy.', '2009-02-11 10:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
