(5250469, 764614, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great expression; I love it when dogs cock their head like that.  Nice lighting, too.  Not such a big fan of the red background as I think it''s a little overwhelming with his coloring.  I''d play with hue shifts and some desaturation to get the background to recede a little visually so he can have my full attention.</td>', 'Great expression; I love it when dogs cock their head like that.  Nice lighting, too.  Not such a big fan of the red background as I think it''s a little overwhelming with his coloring.  I''d play with hue shifts and some desaturation to get the background to recede a little visually so he can have my full attention.', '2009-02-11 10:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5250471, 763188, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice fish shot; wonderfully clear and nice DOF.  Also rather pleasing shape to his body here, and the purplish hue gets you a bonus point from me ;-)</td>', 'Very nice fish shot; wonderfully clear and nice DOF.  Also rather pleasing shape to his body here, and the purplish hue gets you a bonus point from me ;-)', '2009-02-11 10:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
