(5251850, 764483, 33392, '<td valign="top">This isnt a cut at your photo (it''s fairly well done), but if I see another close up face shot of a cat I think I am going to scream.  It''s too bad there are so many of them.  My senses are getting dulled by the repetition.<br/> <br/>This may be better with a different fstop.  The nose is perfectly focused, but the eyes are a bit soft.  Most cat shots focus in on the eyes, which are the primary feature, IMO.</td>', 'This isnt a cut at your photo (it''s fairly well done), but if I see another close up face shot of a cat I think I am going to scream.  It''s too bad there are so many of them.  My senses are getting dulled by the repetition. This may be better with a different fstop.  The nose is perfectly focused, but the eyes are a bit soft.  Most cat shots focus in on the eyes, which are the primary feature, IMO.', '2009-02-11 20:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5251854, 763703, 33392, '<td valign="top">Talk about being in your face!<br/> <br/>This doesn''t do too much for me.  Not sure if its the photo or the crop.</td>', 'Talk about being in your face! This doesn''t do too much for me.  Not sure if its the photo or the crop.', '2009-02-11 20:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
