(5251894, 764397, 65234, '<td valign="top">Or, as my Grey and I say, s-t-r-e-t-c-h!  I am envious of the plumage; my girl is a plucker.  I like the pose, needless to say, and you got the all-important catchlight in the eye.  Crop is a little too tight on the top and left (bet you knew that already) and though the light isn''t as harsh as some I''ve seen it still seems like a fill light from the left might have improved this.  Bonus point for it being a Grey ;-)</td>', 'Or, as my Grey and I say, s-t-r-e-t-c-h!  I am envious of the plumage; my girl is a plucker.  I like the pose, needless to say, and you got the all-important catchlight in the eye.  Crop is a little too tight on the top and left (bet you knew that already) and though the light isn''t as harsh as some I''ve seen it still seems like a fill light from the left might have improved this.  Bonus point for it being a Grey ;-)', '2009-02-11 20:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
