(5251905, 764064, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, I love bunnies :-)  I have a black and white girl who looks a lot like this from a similar perspective, though I''m betting she''s older than this model (my girl is about 7).  I think a fill light from the right would have helped bring out the rest of the detail on the face, and I''d try to arrange the backdrop so there wasn''t such an obvious horizontal line.  I know it''s tough to photograph bunnies, though, so a bonus point for the effort!</td>', 'Aw, I love bunnies :-)  I have a black and white girl who looks a lot like this from a similar perspective, though I''m betting she''s older than this model (my girl is about 7).  I think a fill light from the right would have helped bring out the rest of the detail on the face, and I''d try to arrange the backdrop so there wasn''t such an obvious horizontal line.  I know it''s tough to photograph bunnies, though, so a bonus point for the effort!', '2009-02-11 20:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
