(5252155, 764641, 38248, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog.  The pose is great and I love the eyes and overall sharpness.  I think the bricks add a nice touch also.  With the lighting I''m not sure I''d have gone B/W, but it''s hard to say without seeing the original.  It just seems some detail was lost on the forehead and behind the neck.  Part of that may be my laptop screen.  Overall a great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful dog.  The pose is great and I love the eyes and overall sharpness.  I think the bricks add a nice touch also.  With the lighting I''m not sure I''d have gone B/W, but it''s hard to say without seeing the original.  It just seems some detail was lost on the forehead and behind the neck.  Part of that may be my laptop screen.  Overall a great shot.', '2009-02-11 22:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252156, 764114, 33392, '<td valign="top">He/she looks a bit scared of the whole procedure.  The shadows over the top of the eyes is unfortunate.</td>', 'He/she looks a bit scared of the whole procedure.  The shadows over the top of the eyes is unfortunate.', '2009-02-11 22:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252157, 763315, 33392, '<td valign="top">I wish the chain wasn''t on the neck.  It detracts.  Otherwise, a fine shot.</td>', 'I wish the chain wasn''t on the neck.  It detracts.  Otherwise, a fine shot.', '2009-02-11 22:15:23.000000', NULL, 1);
