(5252181, 764586, 38248, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Nice and sharp.  I''m not sure about the harness, I think it distracts a little from the image, but that''s just nitpicking :-)  It might be keeping him still for the shot and not chasing kids.  Beautiful dog and nice capture.</td>', 'I like it.  Nice and sharp.  I''m not sure about the harness, I think it distracts a little from the image, but that''s just nitpicking :-)  It might be keeping him still for the shot and not chasing kids.  Beautiful dog and nice capture.', '2009-02-11 22:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
