(5252195, 763491, 38248, '<td valign="top">Amazingly sharp and the eyes are beautiful.  I''m not real crazy about the blanket for some reason, maybe it''s the blue and brown mix.  I''d love to see a shot of Kahlua with the dark brown only as the background. Overall I love the shot.  A very beautiful dog and a great name.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Amazingly sharp and the eyes are beautiful.  I''m not real crazy about the blanket for some reason, maybe it''s the blue and brown mix.  I''d love to see a shot of Kahlua with the dark brown only as the background. Overall I love the shot.  A very beautiful dog and a great name.  Nice shot.', '2009-02-11 22:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252199, 763796, 33392, '<td valign="top">Another close-up of a cat face.  This is well lit and has crisp focus.  It''s just getting lost in all the other cat face closeups.</td>', 'Another close-up of a cat face.  This is well lit and has crisp focus.  It''s just getting lost in all the other cat face closeups.', '2009-02-11 22:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
