(5252803, 764510, 103783, '<td valign="top">Not only is this picture beautiful, it really captures the essence of your dog.  He must be an absolute charmer as well as a goofball.  Is that a tennis ball in his mouth?  Ha!  This dog and his photographer should surely win a prize!<b></b></td>', 'Not only is this picture beautiful, it really captures the essence of your dog.  He must be an absolute charmer as well as a goofball.  Is that a tennis ball in his mouth?  Ha!  This dog and his photographer should surely win a prize!', '2009-02-12 09:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
