(5252902, 764513, 86447, '<td valign="top">Having so much space at the top and then cutting off Riley''s legs seems like an odd decision to me... but this is sharply focused and I like the colors and spots all working together.   a 7 from me.   I might have cropped a bit more... maybe at chest level... so it wouldn''t seem like an accident that he has no legs.</td>', 'Having so much space at the top and then cutting off Riley''s legs seems like an odd decision to me... but this is sharply focused and I like the colors and spots all working together.   a 7 from me.   I might have cropped a bit more... maybe at chest level... so it wouldn''t seem like an accident that he has no legs.', '2009-02-12 09:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252903, 763188, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish I had a dollar for every photo with this title on this site.  Or "What are you looking at?"  *grin*<br/> <br/>Perfectly framed and great sharp focus on the face, especially through water.   I wish there weren''t so much noise (I think Neat Image would have cleared up most of it) in the background... and I''m sure some will ask for more contrast or brightness.  Still it''s a 7 from me.</td>', 'I wish I had a dollar for every photo with this title on this site.  Or "What are you looking at?"  *grin* Perfectly framed and great sharp focus on the face, especially through water.   I wish there weren''t so much noise (I think Neat Image would have cleared up most of it) in the background... and I''m sure some will ask for more contrast or brightness.  Still it''s a 7 from me.', '2009-02-12 09:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
