(5252909, 764152, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped off a bit more of the top to bring more focus on Cinnamon''s eyes and put them closer to the top ''thirds'' line.   Still a 7.</td>', 'I''d have cropped off a bit more of the top to bring more focus on Cinnamon''s eyes and put them closer to the top ''thirds'' line.   Still a 7.', '2009-02-12 09:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
