(5252913, 763123, 86447, '<td valign="top">With all of the planning, grooming and lighting (and patience on both parts, I imagine), it seems like the ears would not have been cut off.  *sigh*    Still a 7 from me.</td>', 'With all of the planning, grooming and lighting (and patience on both parts, I imagine), it seems like the ears would not have been cut off.  *sigh*    Still a 7 from me.', '2009-02-12 09:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5252914, 764534, 86447, '<td valign="top">I would have burned the bright spots in Daisy''s eyes... or adjusted the lighting.  Lovely composition and dog.  Nice and sharp.  6 from me, but would have been a 7 with the eyes worked on a bit.<br/> <br/>EDIT:  Just remembered this is Basic editing.   Guess it would have had to been the lighting adjustment.   Bumping to a 7.</td>', 'I would have burned the bright spots in Daisy''s eyes... or adjusted the lighting.  Lovely composition and dog.  Nice and sharp.  6 from me, but would have been a 7 with the eyes worked on a bit. EDIT:  Just remembered this is Basic editing.   Guess it would have had to been the lighting adjustment.   Bumping to a 7.', '2009-02-12 09:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
