(5252917, 764627, 86447, '<td valign="top">Could use some brightness/contrast, I think.    Seems a bit flat.   Still, it''s sharply focused and I like the catchlights in the eyes.   7</td>', 'Could use some brightness/contrast, I think.    Seems a bit flat.   Still, it''s sharply focused and I like the catchlights in the eyes.   7', '2009-02-12 09:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
