(5253262, 764505, 75585, '<td valign="top">I really love your dog - I wish there was eye contact and unfortunately there is a big hot spot on the side of her face and then a heavy shadow on the left side of her body.  That being said, we have a golden puppy ourself - and I wouldn''t have attempted a non-action portrait shot!  She just won''t sit still for that long and if I tired her out she''d have laid there on her back with her tongue hanging out :-)  LOL  So, what I am saying is - hats off to you!!</td>', 'I really love your dog - I wish there was eye contact and unfortunately there is a big hot spot on the side of her face and then a heavy shadow on the left side of her body.  That being said, we have a golden puppy ourself - and I wouldn''t have attempted a non-action portrait shot!  She just won''t sit still for that long and if I tired her out she''d have laid there on her back with her tongue hanging out :-)  LOL  So, what I am saying is - hats off to you!!', '2009-02-12 12:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253279, 764349, 101377, '<td valign="top">The fence here casts a bad shadow.  Should have been taken in a more open area.</td>', 'The fence here casts a bad shadow.  Should have been taken in a more open area.', '2009-02-12 12:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253284, 764631, 101377, '<td valign="top">Well done with great lighting (or lack thereof).</td>', 'Well done with great lighting (or lack thereof).', '2009-02-12 12:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253292, 764430, 47470, '<td valign="top">Your kitty isn''t very "nosey," is she? : )</td>', 'Your kitty isn''t very "nosey," is she? : )', '2009-02-12 12:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253297, 764145, 47470, '<td valign="top">The afghan definitely brings out the eyes.  Nice choice of background!  I might have opted for just a tiny bit more DOF to make sure her ears were sharp too.</td>', 'The afghan definitely brings out the eyes.  Nice choice of background!  I might have opted for just a tiny bit more DOF to make sure her ears were sharp too.', '2009-02-12 12:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253307, 763387, 47470, '<td valign="top">The orange seems unnaturally saturated.</td>', 'The orange seems unnaturally saturated.', '2009-02-12 12:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253311, 762922, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the red adds some nice detail, but I think the blue might be a little distracting.</td>', 'I think the red adds some nice detail, but I think the blue might be a little distracting.', '2009-02-12 12:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253320, 763252, 47470, '<td valign="top">It looks like you might have been too close for your camera to focus properly.</td>', 'It looks like you might have been too close for your camera to focus properly.', '2009-02-12 12:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253323, 764387, 47470, '<td valign="top">Was this taken with a Lensbaby with a paw print aperture?  Cool idea, if it was!  I might have changed the lighting a bit to prevent the "scary" reflection in his eyes.</td>', 'Was this taken with a Lensbaby with a paw print aperture?  Cool idea, if it was!  I might have changed the lighting a bit to prevent the "scary" reflection in his eyes.', '2009-02-12 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
