(5253329, 764257, 98005, '<td valign="top">When I stop laughing I''m going to hit the 9 button.  Thanks for the laugh.</td>', 'When I stop laughing I''m going to hit the 9 button.  Thanks for the laugh.', '2009-02-12 12:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
