(5253504, 763486, 29748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and the coloring and lighting is excellent.</td>', 'Beautiful, and the coloring and lighting is excellent.', '2009-02-12 15:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253505, 764058, 29748, '<td valign="top">Ranger is sweet!</td>', 'Ranger is sweet!', '2009-02-12 15:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253506, 763123, 29748, '<td valign="top">Love the pose and the lighting.</td>', 'Love the pose and the lighting.', '2009-02-12 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253507, 763628, 29748, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.</td>', 'Great portrait.', '2009-02-12 15:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253526, 764534, 100773, '<td valign="top">I had the same "problem" with my own dog, that the white part of the eye is showing to much. I solved the problem by click with a small metal-object on top of the lens hood to get his attention in that direction instead of his owner. She looks like a beautifull dog though!</td>', 'I had the same "problem" with my own dog, that the white part of the eye is showing to much. I solved the problem by click with a small metal-object on top of the lens hood to get his attention in that direction instead of his owner. She looks like a beautifull dog though!', '2009-02-12 15:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253535, 763937, 29748, '<td valign="top">Bella is so beautiful.  Excellent capture and the lighting is perfect.10</td>', 'Bella is so beautiful.  Excellent capture and the lighting is perfect.10', '2009-02-12 15:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253537, 764127, 29748, '<td valign="top">The backround lighting is too harsh as there is some wrap around.</td>', 'The backround lighting is too harsh as there is some wrap around.', '2009-02-12 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253547, 763822, 29748, '<td valign="top">Way too cute!</td>', 'Way too cute!', '2009-02-12 15:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253548, 764289, 29748, '<td valign="top">Soo cute!</td>', 'Soo cute!', '2009-02-12 15:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253551, 763628, 100773, '<td valign="top">I discovered something while shooting my own dog (which actually sounded quite bad, but you know what I mean). Anok is probably paying attention to you instead of the lens, or anywhere else, so the white part of his eyes are very much visible. I guess that can be a matter of taste and appeal, but I found my photos getting much more depth and focus when I tried to prevent those parts of showing. Anyway, this a very, very good photo, and your greyscale toning is spot on. Your pet looks absolutely beautifull too!</td>', 'I discovered something while shooting my own dog (which actually sounded quite bad, but you know what I mean). Anok is probably paying attention to you instead of the lens, or anywhere else, so the white part of his eyes are very much visible. I guess that can be a matter of taste and appeal, but I found my photos getting much more depth and focus when I tried to prevent those parts of showing. Anyway, this a very, very good photo, and your greyscale toning is spot on. Your pet looks absolutely beautifull too!', '2009-02-12 15:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253553, 764493, 100773, '<td valign="top">I haven''t seen all of the photos yet, but so far I hope this wins, or at least ribbon. God knows what Fritz is thinking!</td>', 'I haven''t seen all of the photos yet, but so far I hope this wins, or at least ribbon. God knows what Fritz is thinking!', '2009-02-12 15:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253556, 764457, 100773, '<td valign="top">Adorable! I have to show this to my girlfreind, she would melt at the sight if this cat! Such beautifull eyes too!</td>', 'Adorable! I have to show this to my girlfreind, she would melt at the sight if this cat! Such beautifull eyes too!', '2009-02-12 15:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253564, 762730, 100773, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a tricky shot. Cats face is about just right, but the belly is overexposed. Very nice captured nevertheless!</td>', 'Now that''s a tricky shot. Cats face is about just right, but the belly is overexposed. Very nice captured nevertheless!', '2009-02-12 15:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253576, 764594, 100773, '<td valign="top">I struggled alot with lighting and trying to move the flash so it wouldn''t reflect in my dogs eyes. I guess it is your flash I see in the eye there, and I would tro to avoid that if possible. Good shot of nice looking dog!</td>', 'I struggled alot with lighting and trying to move the flash so it wouldn''t reflect in my dogs eyes. I guess it is your flash I see in the eye there, and I would tro to avoid that if possible. Good shot of nice looking dog!', '2009-02-12 15:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253577, 764618, 100773, '<td valign="top">The flash is to "visible" in the eyes of this cute dog. Takes away some personality</td>', 'The flash is to "visible" in the eyes of this cute dog. Takes away some personality', '2009-02-12 15:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253635, 764589, 86090, '<td valign="top">You got to love a pet that puts up with the lights, setting and camera... Good boy!!!</td>', 'You got to love a pet that puts up with the lights, setting and camera... Good boy!!!', '2009-02-12 16:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253636, 764220, 86090, '<td valign="top">beautiful outdoor portrait. 9</td>', 'beautiful outdoor portrait. 9', '2009-02-12 16:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253639, 764289, 86090, '<td valign="top">you are great, you even got him to put his ears down, like you really caught him doing something wrong. Priceless</td>', 'you are great, you even got him to put his ears down, like you really caught him doing something wrong. Priceless', '2009-02-12 16:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253642, 763828, 86090, '<td valign="top">I love that look!</td>', 'I love that look!', '2009-02-12 16:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253644, 763796, 86090, '<td valign="top">wow! beautiful green eyes. great focus and nice use of lighting</td>', 'wow! beautiful green eyes. great focus and nice use of lighting', '2009-02-12 16:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253652, 764546, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love how you captured the shiny skin. It makes me want to touch it.</td>', 'I love how you captured the shiny skin. It makes me want to touch it.', '2009-02-12 16:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253655, 763490, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great warm light catching his/her eye. Composition works well with the profile.</td>', 'Great warm light catching his/her eye. Composition works well with the profile.', '2009-02-12 16:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253659, 764614, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great expression. Nice soft lighting... I''m not sure I get the need for the rim/back light on the left. I think I''d like a more neutral background to complement the warm tones in the fur. (sorry for all the suggestions... still a great shot... the expression is wonderful)</td>', 'Wow! Great expression. Nice soft lighting... I''m not sure I get the need for the rim/back light on the left. I think I''d like a more neutral background to complement the warm tones in the fur. (sorry for all the suggestions... still a great shot... the expression is wonderful)', '2009-02-12 16:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253661, 764187, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pose and composition. On-camera flash is a bit flat and doesn''t flatter the eyes. Beautiful dog.</td>', 'Beautiful pose and composition. On-camera flash is a bit flat and doesn''t flatter the eyes. Beautiful dog.', '2009-02-12 16:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253662, 764580, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. I''m sure this was difficult to capture detail in the whites. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great lighting. I''m sure this was difficult to capture detail in the whites. Nicely done.', '2009-02-12 16:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253666, 763188, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great capture! The DoF is perfect to highlight the important parts of the shot. The tail fills the frame nicely without dominating.</td>', 'Great capture! The DoF is perfect to highlight the important parts of the shot. The tail fills the frame nicely without dominating.', '2009-02-12 16:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253667, 764025, 88204, '<td valign="top">Fun expression, great lighting.</td>', 'Fun expression, great lighting.', '2009-02-12 16:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253669, 763583, 88204, '<td valign="top">Adorable! Great expressions. Either you have well-behaved dogs or you''re a miracle worker (or both). Nice lighting to not lose detail in the fur. 9</td>', 'Adorable! Great expressions. Either you have well-behaved dogs or you''re a miracle worker (or both). Nice lighting to not lose detail in the fur. 9', '2009-02-12 16:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253671, 762730, 95137, '<td valign="top">Great pose, the highlights are blown which detracts from the image though.</td>', 'Great pose, the highlights are blown which detracts from the image though.', '2009-02-12 16:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5253672, 762800, 88204, '<td valign="top">Cute shot if it was sharp. A little too blurry for my tastes.</td>', 'Cute shot if it was sharp. A little too blurry for my tastes.', '2009-02-12 16:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
