(5254715, 763420, 11467, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.<br/>Love the colour of the eyes.<br/>A shame that you can see some wrinkles in the background. Either move the cat further from the background so it falls more out of focus, or move the light closer tothe subject which will result in a faster light falloff towards the background, and it will become darker.<br/>Good exposure and good focus.<br/>The expression is priceless.</td>', 'Gorgeous.Love the colour of the eyes.A shame that you can see some wrinkles in the background. Either move the cat further from the background so it falls more out of focus, or move the light closer tothe subject which will result in a faster light falloff towards the background, and it will become darker.Good exposure and good focus.The expression is priceless.', '2009-02-13 09:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
