(5254863, 764456, 11467, '<td valign="top">Ahahahah I have one of those too. I nearly entered a picture of it,but instead entered a picture on my cat. I entered some outtakes of our mongolian gerbl in the comments of my entry, look after the challenge .<br/> <br/>Love the photo Great framing and the lighting looks good too. 8</td>', 'Ahahahah I have one of those too. I nearly entered a picture of it,but instead entered a picture on my cat. I entered some outtakes of our mongolian gerbl in the comments of my entry, look after the challenge . Love the photo Great framing and the lighting looks good too. 8', '2009-02-13 10:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5254865, 763123, 11467, '<td valign="top">Very nice.<br/>Great lighting <br/>Cropped a little too tight at the top, and the use of a soft box makes the fur appear very matt and dull. If you used a more spectral light source like a silver umbrella or beauty dish, there would be a bit more shine in the fur.<br/>Beautiful looking dog by the way.</td>', 'Very nice.Great lighting Cropped a little too tight at the top, and the use of a soft box makes the fur appear very matt and dull. If you used a more spectral light source like a silver umbrella or beauty dish, there would be a bit more shine in the fur.Beautiful looking dog by the way.', '2009-02-13 10:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5254893, 763634, 56254, '<td valign="top">really great pic ... I love the angle you chose to shoot from!</td>', 'really great pic ... I love the angle you chose to shoot from!', '2009-02-13 11:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
