(5255326, 764051, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the fur.  I think I would have included the mouth in the crop and/or angled it a bit more; the composition feels off to me.  Not a fan of the glowing green pupils; I would suggest either bouncing the flash off the ceiling or in PP desaturating and darkening the greens or shifting the greens to brown and darkening.</td>', 'Good detail on the fur.  I think I would have included the mouth in the crop and/or angled it a bit more; the composition feels off to me.  Not a fan of the glowing green pupils; I would suggest either bouncing the flash off the ceiling or in PP desaturating and darkening the greens or shifting the greens to brown and darkening.', '2009-02-13 18:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
