(5255984, 764614, 96664, '<td valign="top">O.k. I have looked through all the photos and have commented on a select few... I think this shot will do... better then average... It has now WOW factor but its one of the most beautiful dogs. I think this shot will get top 15 at least. And if not you were robbed of a good photo. The dog is making the funniest faces any dog makes and the red really compliment the color of the dog. This is my personal favorite of this challenge... Well done!</td>', 'O.k. I have looked through all the photos and have commented on a select few... I think this shot will do... better then average... It has now WOW factor but its one of the most beautiful dogs. I think this shot will get top 15 at least. And if not you were robbed of a good photo. The dog is making the funniest faces any dog makes and the red really compliment the color of the dog. This is my personal favorite of this challenge... Well done!', '2009-02-14 10:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5255997, 764631, 43463, '<td valign="top">What really captures and holds our attention in this composition is those amber eyes. But as far as the details to the shape of the cat and the cat itself is mostly lost due to the black backdrop not offering enough contrast. A black on black or white on white is very challenging to do and get it such that it is visually appealing. Judging by your title you wanted your cat to appear on a black backdrop...so I have one thought on how to accomplish it such that the composition could move into the exceptional category. Keep the black backdrop BUT put a specific spotlight on the cat. The light would then illuminate ONLY the cat such that you would have some nice sheen to the black fur plus it would show us some wonderful details on the cat''s body and it''s face. Black is black, but there are many shades of black and by lighting up just the cat with a spotlight we as the viewers would be able to fully appreciate that. 2-14-09 Just remembered another way to make the black cat more distinctive from the black backdrop...if your cat would sit for it that is:-) Placing a small light a foot or two right behind the cat would have the light illuminate the fur and create an outline of the sitting cat like a halo. That ''outlining'' will help keep your main subject separate and apart from that black backdrop allowing this feline to really visually pop off the page.</td>', 'What really captures and holds our attention in this composition is those amber eyes. But as far as the details to the shape of the cat and the cat itself is mostly lost due to the black backdrop not offering enough contrast. A black on black or white on white is very challenging to do and get it such that it is visually appealing. Judging by your title you wanted your cat to appear on a black backdrop...so I have one thought on how to accomplish it such that the composition could move into the exceptional category. Keep the black backdrop BUT put a specific spotlight on the cat. The light would then illuminate ONLY the cat such that you would have some nice sheen to the black fur plus it would show us some wonderful details on the cat''s body and it''s face. Black is black, but there are many shades of black and by lighting up just the cat with a spotlight we as the viewers would be able to fully appreciate that. 2-14-09 Just remembered another way to make the black cat more distinctive from the black backdrop...if your cat would sit for it that is:-) Placing a small light a foot or two right behind the cat would have the light illuminate the fur and create an outline of the sitting cat like a halo. That ''outlining'' will help keep your main subject separate and apart from that black backdrop allowing this feline to really visually pop off the page.', '2009-02-14 10:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5256100, 764493, 20748, '<td valign="top">I like the overall contrast throughout the photo. The patches of light and dark everywhere looks great.</td>', 'I like the overall contrast throughout the photo. The patches of light and dark everywhere looks great.', '2009-02-14 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5256102, 764525, 20748, '<td valign="top">The diagonal white stripe through the photo makes it very graphic and dynamic. I like.</td>', 'The diagonal white stripe through the photo makes it very graphic and dynamic. I like.', '2009-02-14 11:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5256105, 763966, 20748, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great use of lighting technique but i don''t think the blank stare is doing anything for me.</td>', 'I think this is a great use of lighting technique but i don''t think the blank stare is doing anything for me.', '2009-02-14 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5256124, 763387, 54645, '<td valign="top">I gave this a two. Sorry for the low score. Let me offer some C &amp; C and explanation for the score.<br/> <br/>First, the composition is not engaging. It''s out of focus, and the colors are over saturated. I do not consider tigers as pets, and it appears by your title that you agree that tigers are not pets. Ironically, I may have scored this higher without that title! I consider the title part of the presentation of your work, as it will occasionally guide my interpretation of the photograph. In this case, my first impression was, what an exotic pet, but then you changed that impression and interpretation with the title.</td>', 'I gave this a two. Sorry for the low score. Let me offer some C & C and explanation for the score. First, the composition is not engaging. It''s out of focus, and the colors are over saturated. I do not consider tigers as pets, and it appears by your title that you agree that tigers are not pets. Ironically, I may have scored this higher without that title! I consider the title part of the presentation of your work, as it will occasionally guide my interpretation of the photograph. In this case, my first impression was, what an exotic pet, but then you changed that impression and interpretation with the title.', '2009-02-14 12:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5256125, 762844, 54645, '<td valign="top">The lighting gives this a fierce feeling. I''ll be interested in reading the details to see if this was the intent.</td>', 'The lighting gives this a fierce feeling. I''ll be interested in reading the details to see if this was the intent.', '2009-02-14 12:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
