(5257244, 764457, 102811, '<td valign="top">With so many cats in this challenge it was always going to be tough to stand out from the crowd with a cat pic. This manages to do so, by an absolute mile. I really beautiful image.</td>', 'With so many cats in this challenge it was always going to be tough to stand out from the crowd with a cat pic. This manages to do so, by an absolute mile. I really beautiful image.', '2009-02-15 05:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
