(5257282, 764631, 33182, '<td valign="top">I think this would have stood out more with just a touch of back lighting . Overall this is a great photo (and the first one I commented on).</td>', 'I think this would have stood out more with just a touch of back lighting . Overall this is a great photo (and the first one I commented on).', '2009-02-15 07:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
