(5257506, 763017, 34255, '<td valign="top">I like this scene and it''s a great fit for the challenge, but I think it might be a little more dramatic if you could get your subject closer to the water and compose it so that the horse''s front legs are above the horizon, and have less negative space above.</td>', 'I like this scene and it''s a great fit for the challenge, but I think it might be a little more dramatic if you could get your subject closer to the water and compose it so that the horse''s front legs are above the horizon, and have less negative space above.', '2009-02-15 12:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
