(5257541, 764525, 101309, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is a nice portrait! Thank you!</td>', 'Now THAT is a nice portrait! Thank you!', '2009-02-15 13:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5257544, 763824, 101309, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I bet you are getting some negative comments on their being a person in the photo as well. But I think it adds to this one, and shows the comfort level of the dog and it''s person. I love the subtle coloring and I LOVE the border. Good job!</td>', 'Interesting. I bet you are getting some negative comments on their being a person in the photo as well. But I think it adds to this one, and shows the comfort level of the dog and it''s person. I love the subtle coloring and I LOVE the border. Good job!', '2009-02-15 13:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5257550, 764158, 68586, '<td valign="top">Ah - Dobie Wan Kenobi  :- )<br/> <br/>Handsome dog - but I would compositionally I would have preferred to see both his eyes to the roof of his mouth  . .<br/> <br/>Whether a dog portrait or a human portrait - strong eye contact is always a powerful element.</td>', 'Ah - Dobie Wan Kenobi  :- ) Handsome dog - but I would compositionally I would have preferred to see both his eyes to the roof of his mouth  . . Whether a dog portrait or a human portrait - strong eye contact is always a powerful element.', '2009-02-15 13:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5257552, 764182, 68586, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot - and adorable dog - I''m not even sure what sort it is . .<br/> <br/>To squeezer a little more out of this composition having them either both looking at the camera - or both at each other would have been good - but hey - I took a pet portrait myself - I know what it''s like trying to get a pet to look where you want it too  :- )</td>', 'Sweet shot - and adorable dog - I''m not even sure what sort it is . . To squeezer a little more out of this composition having them either both looking at the camera - or both at each other would have been good - but hey - I took a pet portrait myself - I know what it''s like trying to get a pet to look where you want it too  :- )', '2009-02-15 13:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5257553, 763722, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice idea and I like the PoV - it just lacks a little ''wow''.<br/> <br/>Although you have chosen a very shallow DoF I think including the nose may have been better, and a catchlight in the eyes would have really lifted this.<br/> <br/>Looks lovely and relaxed though  :- )</td>', 'nice idea and I like the PoV - it just lacks a little ''wow''. Although you have chosen a very shallow DoF I think including the nose may have been better, and a catchlight in the eyes would have really lifted this. Looks lovely and relaxed though  :- )', '2009-02-15 13:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
