(5258669, 764387, 11467, '<td valign="top">Ha... love the bokeh.. hate the eyes.. get your flash further away from your camera.<br/>When I only had a P&amp;S camera, I built a periscope for my flash that reflected the light to above the camera. I also used a larger difuser to make the light softer, anyway this helped to avoid red-eye problems</td>', 'Ha... love the bokeh.. hate the eyes.. get your flash further away from your camera.When I only had a P&S camera, I built a periscope for my flash that reflected the light to above the camera. I also used a larger difuser to make the light softer, anyway this helped to avoid red-eye problems', '2009-02-16 06:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
