(5259255, 764503, 59029, '<td valign="top">OK, I like the b/w and use of thirds.<br/> <br/>BUT...*groan* hate to sound like a broken record (if you''ve been following the posting thread) but the ears on a donkey are part of what makes them a donkey.  With the ears cropped out, this could just as easily be a horse.  I have some donkey shots in my portfolio; check them out if you like.  The ears are there.</td>', 'OK, I like the b/w and use of thirds. BUT...*groan* hate to sound like a broken record (if you''ve been following the posting thread) but the ears on a donkey are part of what makes them a donkey.  With the ears cropped out, this could just as easily be a horse.  I have some donkey shots in my portfolio; check them out if you like.  The ears are there.', '2009-02-16 16:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
