(5261487, 764585, 89752, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  A little over exposed up the middle of the shot and the fish seems to lack detail.  But I love the composition.  You either have a very discipline cat or a very dead fish.....</td>', 'Good shot.  A little over exposed up the middle of the shot and the fish seems to lack detail.  But I love the composition.  You either have a very discipline cat or a very dead fish.....', '2009-02-17 21:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
