(5261567, 764335, 100727, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo.  It made me smile.  I can feel the energy of Snoopy.  He''s a survivor!  I also love the wave as it shows the strong current.  I''m not sure how this entry will score but I hope it does well ... knowing how DPC voters vote :)  This photo is very unique and it stands out from the rest.  It''s creative.  It shows the personality of the dog.  The photo tells the story and gives us a glimpse of Snoopy''s hobby.  A lot could be told in this simple photo.  I wish he''s my dog! :)  Good luck!  10!</td>', 'I really love this photo.  It made me smile.  I can feel the energy of Snoopy.  He''s a survivor!  I also love the wave as it shows the strong current.  I''m not sure how this entry will score but I hope it does well ... knowing how DPC voters vote :)  This photo is very unique and it stands out from the rest.  It''s creative.  It shows the personality of the dog.  The photo tells the story and gives us a glimpse of Snoopy''s hobby.  A lot could be told in this simple photo.  I wish he''s my dog! :)  Good luck!  10!', '2009-02-17 22:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
