(5261653, 764599, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is actually a very fine idea.  We all know what a cat looks like, so you have instead chosen to show something <i>about</i> the cat.  Bojangles casts a jaundiced eye over his domain (Is it Mr Bojangles?  Or is it Ms?).  The inescapable conclusion is that in this place, The Big Bo rules!  If he had a little thought bubble above his head, it would doubtless quote Soiuth Park''s Cartman ... <i>"Respect Mah Authoritah!"</i>  My only 10.</td>', 'This is actually a very fine idea.  We all know what a cat looks like, so you have instead chosen to show something about the cat.  Bojangles casts a jaundiced eye over his domain (Is it Mr Bojangles?  Or is it Ms?).  The inescapable conclusion is that in this place, The Big Bo rules!  If he had a little thought bubble above his head, it would doubtless quote Soiuth Park''s Cartman ... "Respect Mah Authoritah!"  My only 10.', '2009-02-17 23:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
