(5263267, 763579, 39218, '<td valign="top">Quite seriously, I think this is my favourite pic in the entire competition... is there something wrong with both of us that we see this as amazing?<br/> <br/>Perhaps I am partial to it because of the breed of dog, which I am familiar with, or maybe the soft bed of hay, but I really think it is the beautiful face... the softness. The title, the fact that she guards your children. <br/> <br/>This should be on the cover of a huge coffee table book, or a wonderful framed portrait on the wall.  <br/> <br/>PLEASE don''t be disheartened by the ''score'' because this photo is a thing of beauty.  <br/> <br/>It almost makes me cry.</td>', 'Quite seriously, I think this is my favourite pic in the entire competition... is there something wrong with both of us that we see this as amazing? Perhaps I am partial to it because of the breed of dog, which I am familiar with, or maybe the soft bed of hay, but I really think it is the beautiful face... the softness. The title, the fact that she guards your children.  This should be on the cover of a huge coffee table book, or a wonderful framed portrait on the wall.   PLEASE don''t be disheartened by the ''score'' because this photo is a thing of beauty.   It almost makes me cry.', '2009-02-18 14:26:22.000000', NULL, 0),
