(5263411, 764349, 39218, '<td valign="top">Look at that SMILE!!!!  I think it''s adorable and even if it doesn''t fit the tight PORTRAIT category, perhaps this IS the way that ELLA needs to be portrayed.  I loved this pic and felt that it showed us a side of her personality that most of the pics in this challenge didn''t reflect.<br/> <br/>This is a PORTRAIT OF ELLA!  I''m glad the chain link fence didn''t cover her eye.  That would have changed the entire pic.  This way, she''s sort of a LITTLE RASCAL dog!<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Look at that SMILE!!!!  I think it''s adorable and even if it doesn''t fit the tight PORTRAIT category, perhaps this IS the way that ELLA needs to be portrayed.  I loved this pic and felt that it showed us a side of her personality that most of the pics in this challenge didn''t reflect. This is a PORTRAIT OF ELLA!  I''m glad the chain link fence didn''t cover her eye.  That would have changed the entire pic.  This way, she''s sort of a LITTLE RASCAL dog! Thanks for sharing.', '2009-02-18 15:17:24.000000', NULL, 0),
