(5263439, 763113, 39218, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot of a guy with a ton of energy.  I have a chocolate, he is ninety pounds now at 8 years old... yet the energy remains. Anyone who has ever known or loved a lab can fill in the blanks of that face.  Or, you could pull out photoshop and do a bit of dodging... personally I think the near silhouette quality of this pic is sort of cool. <br/> <br/>For your own personal enjoyment, I hope you can blow this up huge and put it on your wall to bring smiles to everyone who sees it for the next thirty years.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Fabulous shot of a guy with a ton of energy.  I have a chocolate, he is ninety pounds now at 8 years old... yet the energy remains. Anyone who has ever known or loved a lab can fill in the blanks of that face.  Or, you could pull out photoshop and do a bit of dodging... personally I think the near silhouette quality of this pic is sort of cool.  For your own personal enjoyment, I hope you can blow this up huge and put it on your wall to bring smiles to everyone who sees it for the next thirty years.   ', '2009-02-18 15:28:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263453, 764599, 39218, '<td valign="top">This is SPLENDID!  Wouldn''t change a thing about it... except maybe put it in the top 10?</td>', 'This is SPLENDID!  Wouldn''t change a thing about it... except maybe put it in the top 10?', '2009-02-18 15:33:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263456, 764257, 39218, '<td valign="top">HILARIOUS!!!!</td>', 'HILARIOUS!!!!', '2009-02-18 15:33:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263459, 764366, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  You got a 7 from me because this is the sweetest look.  And the title rocks.</td>', 'LOL!  You got a 7 from me because this is the sweetest look.  And the title rocks.', '2009-02-18 15:34:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263463, 763829, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, if I were closer I''d take her in a heartbeat.  Not sure how Tom and Emma would feel about it, but she''s lovely - very regal, very poised.  And I love the reflection.</td>', 'Oh, if I were closer I''d take her in a heartbeat.  Not sure how Tom and Emma would feel about it, but she''s lovely - very regal, very poised.  And I love the reflection.', '2009-02-18 15:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263464, 764127, 97270, '<td valign="top">Great shot there young lady! You are a star in the making. Keep it up!</td>', 'Great shot there young lady! You are a star in the making. Keep it up!', '2009-02-18 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263473, 764196, 39218, '<td valign="top">There''s something really special about this and I find that I love it more the longer I look at it.  It makes me feel sort of melancholy... like it''s waiting for someone to return for it.  It''s going against the ''law'' of looking into the picture, yet maybe that is what I like about it.  <br/> <br/>Either way, it''s a great pic.  Sometimes I swear people don''t look at the pictures at all.</td>', 'There''s something really special about this and I find that I love it more the longer I look at it.  It makes me feel sort of melancholy... like it''s waiting for someone to return for it.  It''s going against the ''law'' of looking into the picture, yet maybe that is what I like about it.   Either way, it''s a great pic.  Sometimes I swear people don''t look at the pictures at all.', '2009-02-18 15:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263482, 762800, 39218, '<td valign="top">Poor puppy... my condolences on your loss.  How lovely you have such a sweet pic of her.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Poor puppy... my condolences on your loss.  How lovely you have such a sweet pic of her. ', '2009-02-18 15:40:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263484, 764384, 39218, '<td valign="top">Should have been rotated, but what a happy face!</td>', 'Should have been rotated, but what a happy face!', '2009-02-18 15:41:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263508, 764189, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  These guys are champion yappers.</td>', 'LOL!  These guys are champion yappers.', '2009-02-18 15:52:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263511, 764021, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love their wrinkles!  I think the comment that aKiwi left is a good one if you can get a chance to try shooting in natural light.  Hard to do when one works during daylight hours, though, and especially hard if the weather doesn''t cooperate and provide any light!</td>', 'I love their wrinkles!  I think the comment that aKiwi left is a good one if you can get a chance to try shooting in natural light.  Hard to do when one works during daylight hours, though, and especially hard if the weather doesn''t cooperate and provide any light!', '2009-02-18 15:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263513, 764176, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awww - I love the snooze aspect of this!</td>', 'Awww - I love the snooze aspect of this!', '2009-02-18 15:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263514, 763123, 8891, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail! Love the lighting and comp as well. Big congrats on your Blue! Congrats to Jake, too!</td>', 'Amazing detail! Love the lighting and comp as well. Big congrats on your Blue! Congrats to Jake, too!', '2009-02-18 15:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263520, 764114, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous animal and a very good captivating pose.</td>', 'Gorgeous animal and a very good captivating pose.', '2009-02-18 15:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263523, 763819, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the high contrast of this!  Works really well with your dog.  Reminds me of SandyP''s work in a way.</td>', 'I love the high contrast of this!  Works really well with your dog.  Reminds me of SandyP''s work in a way.', '2009-02-18 15:57:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263532, 762922, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dan_Cottle:</b></div><hr/><i> "Thanks heaps everyone for your votes.....except you pathetic low voters who like to vote under 4 for biased reasons!!!"<br/> <br/>Get over yourself. People can have there own opinions on what is good, bad, etc. Arrogance is not a good trait. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh don''t worry I am over it.  I am big enough to not let things like that bother me for too long!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by Dan_Cottle: "Thanks heaps everyone for your votes.....except you pathetic low voters who like to vote under 4 for biased reasons!!!" Get over yourself. People can have there own opinions on what is good, bad, etc. Arrogance is not a good trait.   Oh don''t worry I am over it.  I am big enough to not let things like that bother me for too long!!!', '2009-02-18 16:04:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263577, 764127, 1031, '<td valign="top">Congratulations -- you have some other fine shots in your portfolio too! My son <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=2721" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Isaac</a> has also beaten me head-to-head in a challenge, though he hasn''t advanced his photography nearly as much as you have.<br/> <br/>Keep up the great work!</td>', 'Congratulations -- you have some other fine shots in your portfolio too! My son  Isaac has also beaten me head-to-head in a challenge, though he hasn''t advanced his photography nearly as much as you have. Keep up the great work!', '2009-02-18 16:21:18.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5263586, 764368, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really "coy" look!  Almost like posing for you.  What beautiful eyes.  Oh....and well shot too! :)</td>', 'Really "coy" look!  Almost like posing for you.  What beautiful eyes.  Oh....and well shot too! :)', '2009-02-18 16:23:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263605, 762922, 38162, '<td valign="top">wow!  talk about "poor winner" - seems you have a very high regard for your work, which is terrific, but why such intolerance for criticism?   you act as if we dont like your cat.  we love cats, its just that some of us are not into the exploitive style of this concept.  for the commercial photographers in our midst, Im sure they ranked it very high.  for the fine art photographers, perhaps less so.  and so on.  hope we see you win many more times; will be fun to see if your attitude ends up in the win column as well.  best of luck.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dan_Cottle:</b></div><hr/><i> "Thanks heaps everyone for your votes.....except you pathetic low voters who like to vote under 4 for biased reasons!!!"<br/> <br/>Get over yourself. People can have there own opinions on what is good, bad, etc. Arrogance is not a good trait. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh don''t worry I am over it.  I am big enough to not let things like that bother me for too long!!! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'wow!  talk about "poor winner" - seems you have a very high regard for your work, which is terrific, but why such intolerance for criticism?   you act as if we dont like your cat.  we love cats, its just that some of us are not into the exploitive style of this concept.  for the commercial photographers in our midst, Im sure they ranked it very high.  for the fine art photographers, perhaps less so.  and so on.  hope we see you win many more times; will be fun to see if your attitude ends up in the win column as well.  best of luck. Originally posted by Judi: Originally posted by Dan_Cottle: "Thanks heaps everyone for your votes.....except you pathetic low voters who like to vote under 4 for biased reasons!!!" Get over yourself. People can have there own opinions on what is good, bad, etc. Arrogance is not a good trait.   Oh don''t worry I am over it.  I am big enough to not let things like that bother me for too long!!! ', '2009-02-18 16:31:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263623, 764457, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon. Great cat portrait love the pose.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon. Great cat portrait love the pose.', '2009-02-18 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263624, 763483, 96881, '<td valign="top">Can''t add much onto what has already been said, as they hit most of the points.<br/>I don;t like the crop, there is a lack of space to the Left where the dog is looking.  I feel it is too tight there.<br/>Not sure about the angle and pose you have used.  Would have preferred the dog to be looking at the camera more.  With a Lab, I would love to have seen the dog lying down, head resting forward on its paws and looking up with the big Sad Eyes.  I think that would have portrayed devotion more strongly.<br/>The Top 9 Images are all exceptionally good.  Their lighting is great, the poses are great, and the crops work.  Have a detailed look at those as well to see what they did that maybe you could try or improve on.  Why not use some of the advice here and do a reshoot, and post the new and imroved shot for us then to comment on as well.......<br/>As others have said, lighting, colours, the shadows and flares.......agree with them and can''t add much more.</td>', 'Can''t add much onto what has already been said, as they hit most of the points.I don;t like the crop, there is a lack of space to the Left where the dog is looking.  I feel it is too tight there.Not sure about the angle and pose you have used.  Would have preferred the dog to be looking at the camera more.  With a Lab, I would love to have seen the dog lying down, head resting forward on its paws and looking up with the big Sad Eyes.  I think that would have portrayed devotion more strongly.The Top 9 Images are all exceptionally good.  Their lighting is great, the poses are great, and the crops work.  Have a detailed look at those as well to see what they did that maybe you could try or improve on.  Why not use some of the advice here and do a reshoot, and post the new and imroved shot for us then to comment on as well.......As others have said, lighting, colours, the shadows and flares.......agree with them and can''t add much more.', '2009-02-18 16:47:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263628, 763123, 51269, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit portrait of handsome Jake. Congratulations- and thanks for the critique. So much appreciate your comments (so does Zeke :)</td>', 'Beautifully lit portrait of handsome Jake. Congratulations- and thanks for the critique. So much appreciate your comments (so does Zeke :)', '2009-02-18 16:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263642, 762922, 67343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon very cute.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon very cute.', '2009-02-18 16:54:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263692, 764368, 66524, '<td valign="top">That is a "look" if ever I saw one!  Well done.</td>', 'That is a "look" if ever I saw one!  Well done.', '2009-02-18 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5263720, 763483, 51269, '<td valign="top">thanks so much everyone from me &amp;MY friend Zeke !<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=675391" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/51269/120/675391.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/51269/120/675391.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/51269/120/675391.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-18 17:32:07.</i></td>', 'thanks so much everyone from me &MY friend Zeke !', '2009-02-18 17:30:34.000000', '2009-02-18 17:32:07.000000', 0),
