(5263760, 764528, 61651, '<td valign="top">I hate "shame about" comments, as if the composition couldn''t possibly have been intended.  I entered the last pet portrait challenge with a cropped ear kitty, so I''m part of the club too!<br/> <br/>I rated this one of my 9s - I liked her direct and serious gaze, just a tad pissed off.  Lighting highlights in the eyes are very nice.</td>', 'I hate "shame about" comments, as if the composition couldn''t possibly have been intended.  I entered the last pet portrait challenge with a cropped ear kitty, so I''m part of the club too! I rated this one of my 9s - I liked her direct and serious gaze, just a tad pissed off.  Lighting highlights in the eyes are very nice.', '2009-02-18 17:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
