(5263808, 762922, 37845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> hope we see you win many more times; will be fun to see if your attitude ends up in the win column as well.  best of luck. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Why some people feel compelled to chase some of DPC''s most dedicated, cooperative, and hard working members away from these contests is beyond me. <br/> <br/>I think all of us are frustrated by very low votes, and would like to understand them better. Judi, you have as much right to express your frustration, as they do in voting low to begin with. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: hope we see you win many more times; will be fun to see if your attitude ends up in the win column as well.  best of luck.   Why some people feel compelled to chase some of DPC''s most dedicated, cooperative, and hard working members away from these contests is beyond me.  I think all of us are frustrated by very low votes, and would like to understand them better. Judi, you have as much right to express your frustration, as they do in voting low to begin with.  ', '2009-02-18 17:57:49.000000', NULL, 0),
