(5263956, 762922, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the white background, but that ribbon look wilted or something to me... and I still can''t figure out what the blue stuff is.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon, though.  Socks has STILL GOT IT!  LOL!  :)<br/> <br/>Edit to add... clean your sensor or clone.  *grin*  (preaching to the choir here... *sigh* )<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-18 19:50:48.</i></td>', 'I like the white background, but that ribbon look wilted or something to me... and I still can''t figure out what the blue stuff is. Congrats on your ribbon, though.  Socks has STILL GOT IT!  LOL!  :) Edit to add... clean your sensor or clone.  *grin*  (preaching to the choir here... *sigh* )', '2009-02-18 19:50:08.000000', '2009-02-18 19:50:48.000000', 0),
