(5263991, 762922, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the white background, but that ribbon look wilted or something to me... and I still can''t figure out what the blue stuff is.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon, though.  Socks has STILL GOT IT!  LOL!  :)<br/> <br/>Edit to add... clean your sensor or clone.  *grin*  (preaching to the choir here... *sigh* ) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Maybe I am not seeing it on my monitor...where do I need to clone out?  And keep in mind it is basic editing.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: I like the white background, but that ribbon look wilted or something to me... and I still can''t figure out what the blue stuff is. Congrats on your ribbon, though.  Socks has STILL GOT IT!  LOL!  :) Edit to add... clean your sensor or clone.  *grin*  (preaching to the choir here... *sigh* )   Maybe I am not seeing it on my monitor...where do I need to clone out?  And keep in mind it is basic editing.', '2009-02-18 19:59:37.000000', NULL, 0),
