(5264134, 762922, 38162, '<td valign="top"><br/>Thankyou for this.  I am not saying that I shouldn''t get low votes....because I believe I should get low votes.  But to get low votes indicates there is an error in my skills.  And I need to know where those errors are so I can improve.  Just like any person on here.  But how can that happen if the voters do not tell me where those errors are? [/quote]<br/> <br/>well, Im retired and dont have the time to comment on hundreds of images that I rank low.  I think you expect far too much here.  hopefully this exchange will prompt more critique, but I doubt it.  gl</td>', 'Thankyou for this.  I am not saying that I shouldn''t get low votes....because I believe I should get low votes.  But to get low votes indicates there is an error in my skills.  And I need to know where those errors are so I can improve.  Just like any person on here.  But how can that happen if the voters do not tell me where those errors are? [/quote] well, Im retired and dont have the time to comment on hundreds of images that I rank low.  I think you expect far too much here.  hopefully this exchange will prompt more critique, but I doubt it.  gl', '2009-02-18 22:09:21.000000', NULL, 0),
